{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteMask"},{"type":"text","value":" type extends the "},{"type":"link","href":"./ToOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ToOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" type and has other the necessary properties to create a route mask."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"routemask-properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"RouteMask properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteMask"},{"type":"text","value":" type accepts an object with the following properties:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tooptions","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"...ToOptions"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./ToOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ToOptions"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options that will be used to configure the route mask"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options-routetree","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.routeTree"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TRouteTree"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The route tree that this route mask will support"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options-unmaskonreload","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.unmaskOnReload"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", the route mask will be removed when the page is reloaded"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"routemask-properties","text":"RouteMask properties","level":2},{"id":"tooptions","text":"...ToOptions","level":3},{"id":"options-routetree","text":"options.routeTree","level":3},{"id":"options-unmaskonreload","text":"options.unmaskOnReload","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `RouteMask` type extends the [`ToOptions`](./ToOptionsType.md) type and has other the necessary properties to create a route mask.\n\n## RouteMask properties\n\nThe `RouteMask` type accepts an object with the following properties:\n\n### `...ToOptions`\n\n- Type: [`ToOptions`](./ToOptionsType.md)\n- Required\n- The options that will be used to configure the route mask\n\n### `options.routeTree`\n\n- Type: `TRouteTree`\n- Required\n- The route tree that this route mask will support\n\n### `options.unmaskOnReload`\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, the route mask will be removed when the page is reloaded\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RouteMaskType\ntitle: RouteMask type\n---\n\nThe `RouteMask` type extends the [`ToOptions`](./ToOptionsType.md) type and has other the necessary properties to create a route mask.\n\n## RouteMask properties\n\nThe `RouteMask` type accepts an object with the following properties:\n\n### `...ToOptions`\n\n- Type: [`ToOptions`](./ToOptionsType.md)\n- Required\n- The options that will be used to configure the route mask\n\n### `options.routeTree`\n\n- Type: `TRouteTree`\n- Required\n- The route tree that this route mask will support\n\n### `options.unmaskOnReload`\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, the route mask will be removed when the page is reloaded\n"}
